. * Analytic weights
. * The fixed effects estimator in xtreg requires that the weight is constant w
> ithin each panel (household, here "hid").
. * Therefore, we create a household-level (panel-level) weight by averaging ph
> rf within each household.
. * This ensures phrf_panel is constant for all years of the same household and
>  can be safely used in xtreg, fe.
